#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:3
#: 10a439a752a743fda31f93d98dbecfed
msgid "永久分叉（Branch Fork）"
msgstr "Branch Fork"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:5
#: 3ea003808aaf4550be8db53450039862
msgid "**分类：** 容器"
msgstr "**Category:** Containers"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:7
#: b9061b2039984675bd83d4c104bacbe1
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:9
#: 8ddb48cb0f684ed98dc12e9adbec36a4
msgid "把同一份输入送入多条独立分支。每条分支可以继续串联多张卡，最后选择保留各自输出，或显式合并为一个数据集。"
msgstr ""
"Send the same input into multiple independent branches. Each branch can contain its "
"own sequence of cards. At the end, either retain the branch outputs separately or "
"merge them explicitly into one dataset."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:11
#: f7bb90ceb826435f912b1ee53f5b16a0
msgid ""
"它与 [分支合并](card-group.md) 的区别是：`Branch Merge` 的同层子卡运行后立即合并；`Branch Fork` "
"的每条分支可以先经过自己的多步卡片链。"
msgstr ""
"Unlike [Branch Merge](card-group.md), which merges sibling-card outputs immediately "
"after they run, `Branch Fork` lets each branch pass through its own multi-step card "
"chain first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:13
#: 0f46578f5dd042f8835338fae4277349
msgid "工作原理"
msgstr "How It Works"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:15
#: ad4f3e177b364d189f364c3f299b0f72
msgid "设输入为 $D$，第 $i$ 条分支中的卡片链为 $F_i$："
msgstr "Let $D$ be the input and $F_i$ the card chain in branch $i$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:17
#: 4349a550630945dfbb0a910bd54383cc
msgid ""
"\n"
"O_i = F_i(D),\\qquad\n"
"O_{\\mathrm{merge}} = O_1 \\mathbin{\\Vert} O_2 \\mathbin{\\Vert} \\cdots "
"\\mathbin{\\Vert} O_n.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:22
#: 1d55710f49f4451bb7fd8fe54be2c842
msgid "其中 $O_i$ 是分支输出，$\\Vert$ 表示按界面顺序拼接。独立输出模式保留各 $O_i$；合并模式生成 $O_{\\mathrm{merge}}$。"
msgstr ""
"Here $O_i$ is a branch output and $\\Vert$ denotes concatenation in the order shown "
"in the interface. Separate-output mode retains each $O_i$, while merge mode produces "
"$O_{\\mathrm{merge}}$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:24
#: 8fdc5fecf3654d08bf79e13418948166
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:26
#: 42c0150dd31648d8ac00997072274cee
msgid "输入 1 个结构，建立两条分支："
msgstr "Start with one input structure and create two branches:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:28
#: dd356c2431d54083ae42daa9825835d1
msgid ""
"Branch Fork\n"
"  ├─ A: Random Slab → Atomic Perturb       → 6 个\n"
"  └─ B: Lattice Strain → Geometry Filter   → 4 个\n"
msgstr ""
"Branch Fork\n"
"  ├─ A: Random Slab → Atomic Perturb       → 6 structures\n"
"  └─ B: Lattice Strain → Geometry Filter   → 4 structures\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:34
#: d27fdf9700d140b9851b2e0624422935
msgid "选择“保留独立输出”时，得到 A、B 两份结果；选择“合并为一个输出”时："
msgstr ""
"Choose `Keep separate outputs` to obtain separate results for A and B. Choose `Merge "
"into one output` to obtain:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:36
#: 767d3bd5e4a743649045cd6c95e71ec1
msgid ""
"\n"
"|O_{\\mathrm{merge}}|=|O_A|+|O_B|=6+4=10.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:40
#: 32de13fc4533406d9f6505fe80285e03
msgid "卡片会直接显示 `A 6 + B 4 → 合并 10`。"
msgstr "The card displays `A 6 + B 4 → merged 10` directly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:42
#: 34536c11c85b410488aabfa4dfb56040
msgid "界面操作"
msgstr "Using the Interface"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:44
#: bc55e43c729f4a1b96efaffaea1f77eb
msgid "点击分支空白区选中目标分支，再从卡片库添加卡片。"
msgstr "Click an empty area in a branch to select it, then add a card from the card library."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:45
#: cdae7247627846ffb7f4334a0766a4e4
msgid "在分支名称输入框中直接改名；名称会随工作流配置保存。"
msgstr ""
"Rename a branch directly in its name field. The name is saved with the workflow "
"configuration."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:46
#: e6acab6440e84489ac1fee391c217f5c
msgid "使用“添加分支”增加分支；一个永久分叉最多三条。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Add branch` to create another branch. One Branch Fork supports at most three "
"branches."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:47
#: 13c169d2424b46309ac9ff5d27a5eafa
msgid "选择“保留独立输出”或“合并为一个输出”，再运行工作流。"
msgstr "Choose `Keep separate outputs` or `Merge into one output`, then run the workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:49
#: f990c6bf25624080aeb7cbc26ffa65f9
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:51
#: 79a413f248b94306b089c69109057078
msgid "分支（branches）"
msgstr "Branches (branches)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:53
#: 074174fe51894066adc6f16da9eb43cd
msgid "分支列表。每条分支保存稳定 `id`、显示名称、启用状态和内部卡片顺序。不同分支始终从同一份 Fork 输入开始。"
msgstr ""
"List of branches. Each branch stores a stable `id`, display name, enabled state, and "
"internal card order. Every branch always starts from the same Fork input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:55
#: 472ea554d42e434382c2b3bcac682ca2
msgid "显式合并（merge）"
msgstr "Explicit Merge (merge)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:57
#: 25bb03127f5b4279af80e8eb52567c7f
msgid "布尔值，默认 `false`。"
msgstr "Boolean, default `false`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:59
#: fe52d80954644e80b924b6811571ee04
msgid "`false`：每条分支保留自己的最终输出；Fork 后不能连接共同下游卡片。"
msgstr ""
"`false`: Each branch retains its own final output. A shared downstream card cannot be"
" connected after the Fork."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:60
#: c6b08ace70be4228a018a3bc83f84fef
msgid "`true`：所有启用分支成功后，按分支顺序拼接输出；拼接结果成为后续卡片输入。"
msgstr ""
"`true`: After every enabled branch succeeds, concatenate their outputs in branch "
"order. The concatenated result becomes the input to downstream cards."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:62
#: 837da83e2ad14d9f9a0c670b9ff57339
msgid "`Merge` 只拼接，不去重或筛选。"
msgstr "`Merge` only concatenates outputs; it does not deduplicate or filter them."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:64
#: 9986a503381e48cb860872d9ccab84ab
msgid "失败与停止语义"
msgstr "Failure and Stop Behavior"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:66
#: c19bc5ef5ebb4fd48302d407ca4c4188
msgid "启用的分支必须至少包含一张启用卡片，否则会在运行前提示具体分支。"
msgstr ""
"Every enabled branch must contain at least one enabled card. Otherwise, the specific "
"branch is reported before the workflow starts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:67
#: 73700fc7398b4a4fa125bf688b9bfc76
msgid "独立输出模式下，一条分支失败不会删除其他成功分支的输出；卡片显示“部分完成”。"
msgstr ""
"In separate-output mode, failure in one branch does not remove outputs from other "
"successful branches; the card reports `Partially complete`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:68
#: 73a8038f7b2841a4b8af3ef5aa422601
msgid "合并模式下，任一启用分支失败都会阻止 Merge 和共同下游。"
msgstr ""
"In merge mode, failure in any enabled branch prevents the merge and blocks the shared"
" downstream path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:69
#: 3ce82db32c8d4faa9a066b0f7dcd75dc
msgid "停止工作流会停止所有仍在运行的分支卡片；部分结果不会冒充成功输出。"
msgstr ""
"Stopping the workflow stops every branch card that is still running. Partial results "
"are not presented as successful outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:71
#: 126d89fa0fcf4e1ba67633a4ce47c71a
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:73
#: e9cac6c3acfd4946be4c50d40c58eea1
msgid "**为什么不能连接共同下游？** “保留独立输出”没有唯一输出；先切换到“合并输出”。"
msgstr ""
"**Why can I not connect a shared downstream card?** `Keep separate outputs` has no "
"single output. Switch to merged output first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:75
#: c6fb48b969f54a8090ca9344a3f64bef
msgid "**为什么运行前提示空分支？** 启用的分支必须包含至少一张启用卡片；添加卡片或关闭该分支即可。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is an empty branch reported before the run?** An enabled branch must contain at"
" least one enabled card. Add a card or disable that branch."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:77
#: d96c9b88a984404f9177d34b162afb74
msgid "保存字段"
msgstr "Saved Fields"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:79
#: 77c0d6f82b924085b4f48fcce9af922a
msgid "`branches`：各分支的 `id`、名称、启用状态和卡片列表。"
msgstr "`branches`: Each branch's `id`, name, enabled state, and card list."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:80
#: 2f63ba1d8c8f4958ad3ad62cc78d03d5
msgid "`merge`：是否显式合并输出。"
msgstr "`merge`: Whether to merge branch outputs explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:82
#: 8812f702b0934c548853c596f3a76e69
msgid "旧配置中的类名 `WorkflowFork` 和旧显示名称仍可加载。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy class name `WorkflowFork` and legacy display names in existing "
"configurations can still be loaded."
